    {
      "text": "Although long extinct, in rare cases, it can be genetically resurrected from fossils.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "An ancient POKéMON that was recovered from a fossil. It swims by cleverly twisting its 10 tentacles about.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Revived from an ancient fossil, this POKéMON uses air stored in its shell to sink and rise in water.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON from ancient times is said to have navi gated the sea by adeptly twisting its 10 tentacles.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "In prehistoric times, it swam on the sea floor, eating plankton. Its fossils are sometimes found.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "OMANYTE is one of the ancient and long- since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell.",
      "version": "ruby"
