    {
      "text": "Omanyte is one of the ancient and long-since-extinct Pokémon that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Omanyte lived in the seas of antiquity. Its fossils have been found bearing bite marks from Archeops, so apparently Archeops preyed on it.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was restored from an ancient fossil. Those Helix Fossils are excavated from areas that were once oceans long, long ago.",
