      "text": "An ancient Pokémon that was recovered from a fossil. It swam by cleverly twisting its 10 tentacles about.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because some Omanyte manage to escape after being restored or are released into the wild by people, this species is becoming a problem.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon is a member of an ancient, extinct species. Omanyte paddles through water with its 10 tentacles, looking like it’s just drifting along.",
